<section class="founder-hero section"><div class="page-width"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Founder Story</div><h1 class="section-title">FROM AN IDEA.<br>TO A CONCEPT.<br>TO REALITY.</h1><div class="founder-grid"><div><p class="founder-lead">CHAVÉR began with a simple ambition: to create something of my own and build a future with more freedom.</p><p>I started without experience, a large budget or a shortcut. What followed was a process of learning, searching for the right suppliers, refining fabrics and fits, and accepting that building something properly takes time.</p></div><div><p>That process became part of the identity of CHAVÉR. We choose quality over speed and long-term vision over short-term attention.</p><p>FOUNDATIONS is the first chapter: timeless premium essentials designed to feel refined, comfortable and relevant beyond a single season.</p><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:40px">— Founder, CHAVÉR</div></div></div></div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Founder Story","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Founder Story"}]}{% endschema %}